{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Une étoile de moins dans le ciel\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:01:00.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738667519564447795","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"We may lament the loss of our fallen, but remember the ideals he stood for. We are not to quake in the shadow of uncertainty- in the shadow of death.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:01:39.827000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738667684752785519","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"The dead have not given up on us Sir Florian.\" His shade walks over and morphs through Rah, Amara, and countless others.","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:02:28.005000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-31T08:03:01.533000Z","id":"738667886825963601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"At the very least, we must live on for those who are lost, and not wallow in their passing\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:02:49.263000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-31T08:02:54.476000Z","id":"738667975988477952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Did I spur it in them? I see the fire in Sir Wynne and in Sir Percival\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:03:29.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668146805833730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"The desire and need within to sacrifice themselves..\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:03:45.642000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668212459274293","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"What have I done..\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:03:54.474000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668249503367199","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Not at all.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:04:08.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668306696896533","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"I don't know if I can truly say that I'm giving the most good upon the world any more..\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:04:17.729000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668347041775647","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"If those I guide choose a path that leads to sacrifice\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:04:36.160000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668424346992763","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"You brought forth their courage, their love and hopes. You set them on better paths.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:04:36.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668425626517554","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"None of us can guide where they go from there...\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:04:52.422000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668492555026544","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"\"Do I give too much to choice then? Are the freedoms I spew from my country too idealistic to exist in le Chevaliers?\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:05:34.803000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668670313562143","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"638590420254720030","content":"He downs another glass of wine","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:05:45.350000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738668714551148585","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
